<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" creator="open-pilgrimages" version="1.1"><metadata><name>Awa (Temples 1-23)</name><desc>The first of the four dōjō: Temple 1 Ryōzen-ji to Temple 23 Yakuō-ji, 154.5 km along 22 temple-to-temple henro trail relations. The gentlest of the four to pace — no leg between two temples runs longer than 22.7 km, so every day of it can end at a temple. Awa carries the first of the four stages of spiritual progression the pilgrimage maps onto Shikoku&apos;s four provinces: awakening.</desc><copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/</license></copyright><link href="https://open.pilgrimag.es/shikoku-88-awa"><text>Awa (Temples 1-23)</text></link></metadata><trk><name>Awa (Temples 1-23)</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="34.159589" lon="134.502520"/><trkpt lat="34.159363" lon="134.502513"/><trkpt lat="34.159156" lon="134.502499"/><trkpt lat="34.159262" lon="134.502501"/><trkpt lat="34.159278" lon="134.502489"/><trkpt lat="34.159295" lon="134.502450"/><trkpt lat="34.159312" lon="134.502451"/><trkpt lat="34.159363" lon="134.502513"/><trkpt lat="34.159135" lon="134.502498"/><trkpt lat="34.159156" lon="134.502499"/><trkpt lat="34.159062" lon="134.502492"/><trkpt lat="34.159135" lon="134.502498"/><trkpt lat="34.158956" lon="134.502449"/><trkpt lat="34.158958" lon="134.502492"/><trkpt lat="34.159040" lon="134.502490"/><trkpt lat="34.159062" lon="134.502492"/><trkpt lat="34.157956" lon="134.499371"/><trkpt lat="34.157974" lon="134.499438"/><trkpt lat="34.158053" lon="134.499853"/><trkpt lat="34.158153" lon="134.500284"/><trkpt lat="34.158217" lon="134.500456"/><trkpt lat="34.158307" lon="134.500667"/><trkpt lat="34.158579" lon="134.501218"/><trkpt lat="34.158698" lon="134.501467"/><trkpt lat="34.158827" lon="134.501854"/><trkpt lat="34.158872" lon="134.502061"/><trkpt lat="34.158914" lon="134.502291"/><trkpt lat="34.158936" lon="134.502318"/><trkpt lat="34.158955" lon="134.502329"/><trkpt lat